    "Using the 2016/17–2022/23 seasons as training data and the 2023/24–2025/26 seasons as testing data, the previous-season persistence baseline has a test MSE of about **268.57** and a MAD of about **12.78 points**. This performs better than predicting the training-set average for every team, which has a test MSE of about **323.28**.\n",
